<title>USA: Stepan Co to repurchase up to 500,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Stepan Co to repurchase up to 500,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHFIELD, Ill. 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stepan Co said Thursday its board of directors approved the repurchase of up to 500,000 shares in the open market to fund profit sharing, options and deferred bonus plans.  </p>
<p>The chemical company said it has about 10 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Stepan Co shares were unchanged at 19-1/4 thursday.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
